# SCIP's working files for certificate output, and the uncompressed forms.
# The committed artifact is always <name>_complete.vipr.gz; recheck.py expands
# it before calling viprchk and checks the expansion against the recorded
# uncompressed sha256. Sizes and hashes of every form live in each cert_*.json.
*.vipr
*.vipr_ori
*.vipr_der
.raw_*.txt

# 34 MB: too large to commit against a 66 MB repository. Its size, both
# hashes and the exact regeneration command are in ../certs/MANIFEST.md;
# regenerate it, drop it here, and recheck.py will verify it.
cert_n8_M58_complete.vipr.gz
